<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Github-Actions on Aurora</title><link>https://notes.yoooo.fun/tags/github-actions/</link><description>Recent content in Github-Actions on Aurora</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://notes.yoooo.fun/tags/github-actions/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to configure Gradle build on GitHub Actions</title><link>https://notes.yoooo.fun/posts/gradle-build4github-actions/</link><pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2020 15:21:04 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://notes.yoooo.fun/posts/gradle-build4github-actions/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="how-to-configure-gradle-build-on-github-actions"&gt;How to configure Gradle build on GitHub Actions
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;更新说明：本文于 2026-08 重写。原示例使用已废弃的 &lt;code&gt;setup-java v1&lt;/code&gt;、手写 &lt;code&gt;actions/cache&lt;/code&gt; 缓存、默认分支 &lt;code&gt;master&lt;/code&gt;，现已升级为官方推荐方案 &lt;code&gt;gradle/actions/setup-gradle&lt;/code&gt;（内置 wrapper 校验与依赖缓存）。&lt;/p&gt;
